
@startuml ReservationStateDiagram
title 校园二手交易系统 - 预约状态图

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #F5F8FC
    BorderColor #526B85
    ArrowColor #526B85
    FontColor #263748
    RoundCorner 12
}

hide empty description

[*] --> PENDING : 买家成功预约

state "待确认" as PENDING
state "已确认" as CONFIRMED
state "已取消" as CANCELLED
state "已拒绝" as REJECTED
state "已超时" as EXPIRED
state "已完成" as COMPLETED

PENDING --> CONFIRMED : 卖家确认
PENDING --> CANCELLED : 买家取消
PENDING --> REJECTED : 卖家拒绝
PENDING --> EXPIRED : 48小时无回应

CONFIRMED --> COMPLETED : 线下交付并确认收货

CANCELLED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*]

note right of PENDING
同一商品只能有一条有效预约。
取消、拒绝或超时后，
商品恢复可预约状态。
end note

note right of CONFIRMED
确认后买家不能自行取消。
管理员争议处理细则待确认。
end note

@enduml
